# Modify the hand's on-device (firmware) network IPv4 address over the current connection.
# This is NOT the ROS node parameter `device_ip`.
# ROS node: on success the hand for original_ip is removed from the node; call connect with new_ip.
#
# original_ip: which connected hand to command (current session / IP, same role as other services).
# new_ip: IPv4 address written to the device (SDK uses default netmask/gateway).
string original_ip
string new_ip
---
bool success
string message
